/E (We're backed by a family office with a single goal: be the best quality AWS partner in the market a decade from now. That means we grow deliberately. Senior-led pods, not pyramids. No delivery layer of juniors hidden behind a partner name. The firms we respect most all started with the same founding promise and lost it quietly, not through one bad decision, but through a thousand small optimisations for utilisation. We've structured ownership and growth to make that impossible. )
